{"id": "wwdc2017-249", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2017/249", "wordCount": 2772, "segments": [{"start": 18.0, "text": "Hello. My name is Stewart"}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "Montgomery and in this session"}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "we'll discuss how your app can"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "use new APIs and iOS 11 to"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "filter out unwanted SMS and MMS"}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "messages and help users avoid an"}, {"start": 29.0, "text": "increasing nuisance."}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "Before we dive in, let's take a"}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "look at what happens when we"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "receive an unwanted SMS message"}, {"start": 36.0, "text": "in iOS 10.3."}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "Here we see what is pretty"}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "obviously an unwanted, spam SMS."}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "Messages like this are annoying"}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "for users since they play a tone"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "or vibrate just like a normal"}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "message and distract from"}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "whatever you're doing."}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "And if I launch messages it's"}, {"start": 57.0, "text": "right there at the top, mixed in"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "with my real messages and"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "cluttering up the list."}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "Unfortunately some iPhone users"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "get a lot of these messages and"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "they would love to have a way to"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "filter them out."}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "With iOS 11 we are introducing"}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "APIs to allow your app to"}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "analyze the sender and content"}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "of any SMS or MMS message from"}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "an unknown sender and attempt to"}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "filter out those which are"}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "unsolicited. Let me show you how it works."}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "Here on my iPhone running iOS 11"}, {"start": 85.0, "text": "I'll launch the New Messages"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "app."}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "And since I've already installed"}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "a Message Filter app extension"}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "and enabled it in settings I now"}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "see a second tab called SMS"}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "Junk."}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "And if I get a message which the"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "app believes is junk it'll only"}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "appear under that tab."}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "Ah, there's a new message now."}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "Let's see what it is."}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "This is the same message as"}, {"start": 107.0, "text": "before, but now it no longer"}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "appears in the regular list with"}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "my known contacts and doesn't"}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "distract me with a sound or"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "notification."}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "And if I tap to read it I can"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "see from the label at the bottom"}, {"start": 119.0, "text": "that it was marked as junk by an"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "app called Filter It."}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "Now there are a few reasons why"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "we decided to add this"}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "functionality."}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "Unwanted messages, which include"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "any unsolicited or spam messages"}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "a user receives, have been an"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "increasing nuisance for users in"}, {"start": 136.0, "text": "the recent years."}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "But beyond the annoyance, what's"}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "more concerning is that often"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "these messages are phishing"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "attempts and include links which"}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "may harm users."}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "So of course we want to prevent"}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "these messages from being"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "delivered whenever possible."}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "Now there's an important"}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "difference worth noting between"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "iMessage and SMS and MMS"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "messages."}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "For iMessage we offer the report"}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "as Junk Service on-device since"}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "those messages are encrypted end"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "to end and delivered over the"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "iMessage network. But we don't have the ability to"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "do this for SMS or MMSs since"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "they are delivered directly from"}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "a wireless carrier to a user's"}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "device."}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "So the filtering of these"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "messages must happen locally"}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "rather than on a centralized"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "server, and that's where these"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "new APIs come in."}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "Finally, we've heard that many"}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "of you have developed expertise"}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "in analyzing messages and"}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "detecting which ones are"}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "unwanted and we're excited to"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "invite apps to help with this"}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "task."}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "So for the remainder of this session I'll cover a few areas"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "in detail."}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "First I'll walk through the"}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "details of what we call Message"}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "Filter Extensions and show how"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "they work."}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "Next I'll talk about some"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "important considerations around"}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "privacy since these extensions"}, {"start": 206.0, "text": "come with some special rules."}, {"start": 208.0, "text": "Then I'll talk about how an"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "extension can check with a"}, {"start": 211.0, "text": "network-backed service, which"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "some apps might find useful and"}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "I'll show a couple of demos"}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "along the way through creating"}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "one of these extensions in"}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "Xcode. So let's get started."}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "The way this works is using"}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "something we call Message Filter"}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "Extensions."}, {"start": 227.0, "text": "So let's talk about those"}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "in-depth."}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "As the name implies, this is a"}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "new app extension type, which"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "your app can include."}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "The APIs for it are in a new"}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "framework in iOS-11 called"}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "Identity Look Up."}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "Now once a user has installed an"}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "app with one of these"}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "extensions, to begin using it"}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "they must first enable the"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "extension in Messages Settings."}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "Only one extension can be"}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "enabled at a time, or if the"}, {"start": 252.0, "text": "user wants to disable the"}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "feature they can choose None."}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "And once it's enabled that"}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "extension is invoked every time"}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "an SMS or MMS message is"}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "received from an unknown sender."}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "And there is some other criteria"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "used when deciding when to send"}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "a message to the extension,"}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "which I'll discuss in a few"}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "minutes. Let's walk through a diagram"}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "showing the overall flow."}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "When a message is received by"}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "the phone it starts in the"}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "Messages app and if it is an SMS"}, {"start": 277.0, "text": "or MMS and it's from a sender"}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "which isn't in the recipient's"}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "contacts, then the extension,"}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "which the user selected in"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "Settings will be launched and"}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "will be passed the messages"}, {"start": 286.0, "text": "sender and body via an object"}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "called IL Message Filter Query"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "Request, which is part of the"}, {"start": 291.0, "text": "identity look-up framework."}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "When the extension receives this"}, {"start": 296.0, "text": "it begins examining the message,"}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "looking at the sender or the"}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "body of the message, or both,"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "and it might check against a"}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "known list of bad phone numbers"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "or it could look for a"}, {"start": 305.0, "text": "suspicious looking web link in"}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "the body, whatever is"}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "appropriate."}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "Ultimately the extension has to"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "form a response using an object"}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "called IL Message Filter Query"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "Response, describing whether to"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "allow or filter the message, and"}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "it sends this back to the Messages app."}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "And once it receives a response,"}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "Messages will either alert the"}, {"start": 324.0, "text": "user normally or suppress the"}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "notification and move the"}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "message thread to the Junk tab."}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "So that's a basic overview of"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "how it works and before we go on"}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "I'd like to touch on a very"}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "important topic, and that's user"}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "privacy."}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "We thought a lot about how to"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "maintain the strong level of"}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "privacy Apple customers expect,"}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "but also allow them to enable"}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "this if they want to confront"}, {"start": 348.0, "text": "this persistent problem of"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "unwanted messages."}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "So there are a few special rules"}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "that extensions must comply with"}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "when using this API."}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "The first rule is that a message"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "recipient's phone number is"}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "never sent to an extension, only"}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "the sender's phone number or"}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "email address is included, since"}, {"start": 364.0, "text": "that's all that should be"}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "required to make a decision"}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "about whether to filter a message."}, {"start": 369.0, "text": "Another key rule is that a"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "message filter extension can"}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "never export the contents of"}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "messages outside its container,"}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "and these extensions have some"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "additional restrictions because"}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "of this."}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "They cannot write to files"}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "shared with their containing app"}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "and they cannot perform network"}, {"start": 383.0, "text": "operations."}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "The reason for this is that,"}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "although some messages may be"}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "unwanted junk, others may be"}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "legitimate and be sent from"}, {"start": 391.0, "text": "someone who's just not on the"}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "recipient's contacts yet."}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "So then it's imperative that all"}, {"start": 395.0, "text": "the messages be kept private and"}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "never exported in any way that"}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "reveals more about the recipient"}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "than what is contained in the"}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "message itself."}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "Although they can't perform"}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "networking themselves, it is"}, {"start": 406.0, "text": "possible for these extensions to"}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "defer a request to their server"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "indirectly, and when an"}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "extension requests to defer iOS"}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "will make a web request on the"}, {"start": 414.0, "text": "extension's behalf in a secure"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "way."}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "We'll see an example of that"}, {"start": 418.0, "text": "later."}, {"start": 419.0, "text": "The main thing to keep in mind"}, {"start": 421.0, "text": "is that your extension should"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "never export messages outside of"}, {"start": 424.0, "text": "its container to maintain user"}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "privacy."}, {"start": 430.0, "text": "Now there is some specific"}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "criteria that the Messages app"}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "uses to decide whether or not to"}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "send a given message to an"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "extension."}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "First, this feature is only used"}, {"start": 438.0, "text": "with SMS and MMS messages and"}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "never with iMessage."}, {"start": 442.0, "text": "As I mentioned earlier, unwanted"}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "iMessages are handled using a"}, {"start": 445.0, "text": "different mechanism, so this"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "only applies to SMS and MMS."}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "As I've mentioned a few times,"}, {"start": 452.0, "text": "only unknown senders, or those"}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "which are not in the recipient's"}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "contacts are actually sent to"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "the extension for analysis."}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "If a sender is in Contacts we"}, {"start": 461.0, "text": "assume that that recipient knows"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "the sender and wants to receive"}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "messages from them."}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "That also means that if a"}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "message is ever miscategorized"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "as junk then the user can add"}, {"start": 470.0, "text": "that sender to their contacts to"}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "ensure they aren't filtered out"}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "in the future."}, {"start": 475.0, "text": "Also, if a user is exchanging"}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "messages with someone who is not"}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "in their Contacts and they reply"}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "to that thread multiple times,"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "then we will stop sending any"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "subsequent messages in that"}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "thread to the extension."}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "Or, if the user replies multiple"}, {"start": 489.0, "text": "times to a thread, which is"}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "already marked as junk, that"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "thread will be restored to the"}, {"start": 493.0, "text": "non-junk tab."}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "Responding multiple times is"}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "interpreted as a signal from the"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "recipient that they really do"}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "want to be communicating with"}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "the sender."}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "So all of this criteria doesn't"}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "directly affect the API, but it"}, {"start": 505.0, "text": "is something you, as a developer"}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "of one of these extensions,"}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "should be aware of when testing"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "or troubleshooting your app."}, {"start": 515.0, "text": "So now I'd like to show a demo"}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "in Xcode of how you can create a"}, {"start": 517.0, "text": "message filter extension."}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "Here we have an app I've made"}, {"start": 522.0, "text": "called Filter It and I'd like to"}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "add a message filter extension."}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "The first thing I need to do is"}, {"start": 528.0, "text": "add a new target."}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "And I'll choose the new message filter template for iOS and I'll"}, {"start": 536.0, "text": "give it a name."}, {"start": 543.0, "text": "I've got a new file added to my"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "project now called"}, {"start": 545.0, "text": "messagefiltereextension.swift."}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "Now let's take a look at that."}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "The first thing we see is a"}, {"start": 561.0, "text": "method called Handle Query"}, {"start": 562.0, "text": "Request with Context and this is"}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "called on our extension so that"}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "it can examine the incoming"}, {"start": 567.0, "text": "message and return a response"}, {"start": 569.0, "text": "using the completion handler."}, {"start": 573.0, "text": "Now the template is structured"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "to first attempt an offline"}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "check using this method, called"}, {"start": 578.0, "text": "Offline Action for Query Request"}, {"start": 581.0, "text": "and it returns an action which"}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "is either allow, filter, or"}, {"start": 585.0, "text": "none."}, {"start": 588.0, "text": "So for this demo what we need to"}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "do is customize this offline"}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "action helper method."}, {"start": 592.0, "text": "Let's look at what it does"}, {"start": 593.0, "text": "currently."}, {"start": 598.0, "text": "Right now it always returns"}, {"start": 599.0, "text": "none, but I'll replace that with"}, {"start": 601.0, "text": "some simple logic to always"}, {"start": 602.0, "text": "filter if the message contains"}, {"start": 604.0, "text": "the word junk."}, {"start": 609.0, "text": "In a real extension this could"}, {"start": 610.0, "text": "do something more sophisticated,"}, {"start": 612.0, "text": "but this works for now and"}, {"start": 614.0, "text": "that's all it takes to create a"}, {"start": 615.0, "text": "simple, offline only, message"}, {"start": 617.0, "text": "filter extension."}, {"start": 622.0, "text": "Now although some apps may be"}, {"start": 623.0, "text": "able to do most or all of their"}, {"start": 624.0, "text": "checking offline, other apps may"}, {"start": 627.0, "text": "find it useful to check with a"}, {"start": 628.0, "text": "network server whether to filter"}, {"start": 629.0, "text": "messages or not."}, {"start": 630.0, "text": "So next I'd like to talk about"}, {"start": 632.0, "text": "network deferral."}, {"start": 634.0, "text": "The best way to show how network"}, {"start": 636.0, "text": "deferral works is with another"}, {"start": 637.0, "text": "diagram."}, {"start": 639.0, "text": "As before, when a message is"}, {"start": 641.0, "text": "received it starts in the"}, {"start": 642.0, "text": "Messages app and is sent to the"}, {"start": 644.0, "text": "chosen extension, but this time"}, {"start": 646.0, "text": "the extension chooses to defer"}, {"start": 648.0, "text": "this request to its network"}, {"start": 649.0, "text": "server, whose URL is specified"}, {"start": 651.0, "text": "in its info.plist."}, {"start": 653.0, "text": "So it tells Messages to defer"}, {"start": 655.0, "text": "and Messages then makes a JSON"}, {"start": 657.0, "text": "request to that server URL."}, {"start": 660.0, "text": "The server then examines the"}, {"start": 661.0, "text": "Messages contents inside the"}, {"start": 662.0, "text": "JSON request and can respond in"}, {"start": 664.0, "text": "any format it wants and that"}, {"start": 666.0, "text": "response is handed right back to"}, {"start": 668.0, "text": "the extension."}, {"start": 670.0, "text": "And from here, the extension"}, {"start": 671.0, "text": "reads the response from the"}, {"start": 672.0, "text": "server and finally returns an IL"}, {"start": 674.0, "text": "message filter query response"}, {"start": 676.0, "text": "back to Messages."}, {"start": 682.0, "text": "There are a few restrictions to"}, {"start": 683.0, "text": "be aware of when using network"}, {"start": 684.0, "text": "deferral."}, {"start": 686.0, "text": "First, the deferred network"}, {"start": 687.0, "text": "requests contain no personally"}, {"start": 689.0, "text": "identifiable information about"}, {"start": 691.0, "text": "the recipient of the message."}, {"start": 695.0, "text": "The network URL is hardcoded"}, {"start": 696.0, "text": "statically into the extension's"}, {"start": 698.0, "text": "info.plist file under a key"}, {"start": 700.0, "text": "called IL Message Filter"}, {"start": 702.0, "text": "Extension Network URL."}, {"start": 704.0, "text": "So it cannot vary between"}, {"start": 706.0, "text": "requests or for individual"}, {"start": 707.0, "text": "users."}, {"start": 713.0, "text": "All URLs must be secure https"}, {"start": 715.0, "text": "and the server must be"}, {"start": 716.0, "text": "configured such that it doesn't"}, {"start": 718.0, "text": "require any app transport"}, {"start": 719.0, "text": "security, or ATS, overrides"}, {"start": 722.0, "text": "since there's no way to configure them."}, {"start": 725.0, "text": "Also, this feature requires that"}, {"start": 727.0, "text": "both your app and server use the"}, {"start": 729.0, "text": "associated domains, or Apple App"}, {"start": 731.0, "text": "Site Association Feature, which"}, {"start": 733.0, "text": "is something you may be familiar"}, {"start": 734.0, "text": "with if you've adopted other iOS"}, {"start": 736.0, "text": "features like App Links or"}, {"start": 738.0, "text": "Shared Web Credentials."}, {"start": 740.0, "text": "And for more information, see"}, {"start": 742.0, "text": "the session; Seamless Linking to"}, {"start": 743.0, "text": "Your App from WWDC2015."}, {"start": 746.0, "text": "And the last restriction to be"}, {"start": 749.0, "text": "aware of is that any cookies"}, {"start": 751.0, "text": "that the webserver attempt to"}, {"start": 752.0, "text": "set will be ignored to maintain"}, {"start": 753.0, "text": "privacy."}, {"start": 758.0, "text": "The request made to the network"}, {"start": 759.0, "text": "server is formatted using JSON"}, {"start": 761.0, "text": "and includes the same things"}, {"start": 763.0, "text": "which are in the IL Message"}, {"start": 764.0, "text": "Filter Query Request Object"}, {"start": 766.0, "text": "including the message sender,"}, {"start": 768.0, "text": "which is a phone number or email"}, {"start": 769.0, "text": "address, and the message body."}, {"start": 773.0, "text": "The request also includes the"}, {"start": 774.0, "text": "version of your app, which is"}, {"start": 776.0, "text": "the CF Bundle Version Key from"}, {"start": 777.0, "text": "the app's info.plist."}, {"start": 780.0, "text": "This may be useful in cases you"}, {"start": 781.0, "text": "have -- in case you have"}, {"start": 782.0, "text": "released several versions of"}, {"start": 784.0, "text": "your app with different"}, {"start": 785.0, "text": "capabilities and need to format"}, {"start": 786.0, "text": "the response to insure that"}, {"start": 788.0, "text": "particular version of the app"}, {"start": 789.0, "text": "can understand it."}, {"start": 791.0, "text": "And we include the version of"}, {"start": 792.0, "text": "the JSON request format itself,"}, {"start": 794.0, "text": "which is currently one."}, {"start": 797.0, "text": "Now, unlike the request format,"}, {"start": 799.0, "text": "the response format is entirely"}, {"start": 800.0, "text": "up to your app to define and"}, {"start": 802.0, "text": "doesn't necessarily have to be"}, {"start": 803.0, "text": "JSON."}, {"start": 805.0, "text": "The response body is passed back"}, {"start": 806.0, "text": "to your extension to parse, so"}, {"start": 808.0, "text": "there are not requirements about"}, {"start": 809.0, "text": "its format."}, {"start": 813.0, "text": "And here's a quick look at the"}, {"start": 814.0, "text": "JSON request format, and you can"}, {"start": 815.0, "text": "see it includes all of the info"}, {"start": 816.0, "text": "I mentioned."}, {"start": 824.0, "text": "Now, let's go back to my Filter"}, {"start": 825.0, "text": "It app and add network deferral"}, {"start": 826.0, "text": "capability to the extension."}, {"start": 832.0, "text": "If we take another look at the"}, {"start": 833.0, "text": "Handle Query Request method from"}, {"start": 835.0, "text": "earlier we can now see that,"}, {"start": 837.0, "text": "after the offline check is"}, {"start": 838.0, "text": "performed, if the action it"}, {"start": 840.0, "text": "returned was none and it falls"}, {"start": 842.0, "text": "into this case of the switch"}, {"start": 843.0, "text": "statement, we assume that this"}, {"start": 845.0, "text": "query request could not be"}, {"start": 846.0, "text": "handled using only an offline"}, {"start": 848.0, "text": "check and actually needs to"}, {"start": 849.0, "text": "consult our network server to"}, {"start": 851.0, "text": "get an answer."}, {"start": 859.0, "text": "To do this our code calls the"}, {"start": 860.0, "text": "defer query requests to network"}, {"start": 862.0, "text": "method on our extension context"}, {"start": 865.0, "text": "and this causes a network"}, {"start": 866.0, "text": "request to be made on our"}, {"start": 867.0, "text": "extension's behalf, which will"}, {"start": 869.0, "text": "call this completion block"}, {"start": 871.0, "text": "asynchronously when it"}, {"start": 872.0, "text": "completes."}, {"start": 873.0, "text": "Inside the completion block, if"}, {"start": 875.0, "text": "there was a response from the"}, {"start": 876.0, "text": "network and there wasn't an"}, {"start": 877.0, "text": "error, we use another helper"}, {"start": 879.0, "text": "method called Action for Network"}, {"start": 881.0, "text": "Response to translate it into an"}, {"start": 883.0, "text": "action."}, {"start": 884.0, "text": "Let's jump to that method and"}, {"start": 885.0, "text": "see what it does."}, {"start": 891.0, "text": "Just like with the offline check"}, {"start": 892.0, "text": "helper method this method"}, {"start": 893.0, "text": "defaults to returning none, but"}, {"start": 895.0, "text": "let's customize that to parse"}, {"start": 897.0, "text": "the response from our server."}, {"start": 899.0, "text": "I'll assume the server returns"}, {"start": 901.0, "text": "JSON, although it doesn't have"}, {"start": 902.0, "text": "to, and I'll use the new"}, {"start": 904.0, "text": "Foundation Decoding APIs in"}, {"start": 906.0, "text": "Swift 4 to decode the response."}, {"start": 909.0, "text": "I'll paste some code I've"}, {"start": 910.0, "text": "already written to do this, but"}, {"start": 912.0, "text": "let's briefly walk through it."}, {"start": 919.0, "text": "I first define a struct, which"}, {"start": 921.0, "text": "describes the JSON format that"}, {"start": 922.0, "text": "my server returns, then I create"}, {"start": 926.0, "text": "a JSON decoder instance and I"}, {"start": 929.0, "text": "use it to decode the data from"}, {"start": 931.0, "text": "the network as an instance of"}, {"start": 932.0, "text": "the struct."}, {"start": 934.0, "text": "Finally I return the action,"}, {"start": 937.0, "text": "which was decoded, and store it"}, {"start": 938.0, "text": "in the struct."}, {"start": 943.0, "text": "And if there were any errors I"}, {"start": 944.0, "text": "handle them below."}, {"start": 948.0, "text": "And return the default response"}, {"start": 949.0, "text": "of none."}, {"start": 954.0, "text": "And just like that we've added"}, {"start": 955.0, "text": "network deferral support to our"}, {"start": 957.0, "text": "message filter app extension."}, {"start": 959.0, "text": "So it now supports both offline"}, {"start": 961.0, "text": "and network checking of incoming"}, {"start": 962.0, "text": "messages."}, {"start": 967.0, "text": "So that's how your app can help"}, {"start": 968.0, "text": "filter unwanted messages using"}, {"start": 970.0, "text": "the new message filter"}, {"start": 971.0, "text": "extensions and identity look up"}, {"start": 973.0, "text": "framework in iOS 11."}, {"start": 975.0, "text": "We've tried to strike a balance"}, {"start": 977.0, "text": "between user privacy and solving"}, {"start": 979.0, "text": "a very pressing need our users"}, {"start": 980.0, "text": "have."}, {"start": 981.0, "text": "And the result is a powerful new"}, {"start": 982.0, "text": "API your app can use, but it is"}, {"start": 985.0, "text": "subject to some special rules"}, {"start": 986.0, "text": "you need to be aware of."}, {"start": 988.0, "text": "So please, download the new STK,"}, {"start": 991.0, "text": "check out the new identity look"}, {"start": 992.0, "text": "up framework, and try making a"}, {"start": 993.0, "text": "message filter extension filter"}, {"start": 997.0, "text": "today."}, {"start": 998.0, "text": "For more information see this"}, {"start": 1000.0, "text": "link for the Sessions page on"}, {"start": 1001.0, "text": "the official WWDC site."}, {"start": 1005.0, "text": "We do have a few related"}, {"start": 1006.0, "text": "sessions and this year's"}, {"start": 1007.0, "text": "conference to mention."}, {"start": 1009.0, "text": "For more information about"}, {"start": 1010.0, "text": "privacy practices on our"}, {"start": 1011.0, "text": "platforms see the Privacy and"}, {"start": 1014.0, "text": "Your Apps session happening in"}, {"start": 1015.0, "text": "the Executive Ballroom on"}, {"start": 1017.0, "text": "Tuesday at 11:20."}, {"start": 1019.0, "text": "And for more info about the new"}, {"start": 1021.0, "text": "foundation and coding APIs I"}, {"start": 1022.0, "text": "showed in my demo, see the new"}, {"start": 1024.0, "text": "-- see the What's New in"}, {"start": 1026.0, "text": "Foundation session in Hall Two"}, {"start": 1028.0, "text": "on Wednesday at 11."}, {"start": 1030.0, "text": "Also, WWDC2015 had an excellent"}, {"start": 1033.0, "text": "session called Seamless Linking"}, {"start": 1035.0, "text": "to Your App, which walked"}, {"start": 1036.0, "text": "through the associated domains"}, {"start": 1038.0, "text": "feature which message filter"}, {"start": 1039.0, "text": "extensions require when using"}, {"start": 1040.0, "text": "network deferral."}, {"start": 1042.0, "text": "So check out that session in the"}, {"start": 1043.0, "text": "archive for details about how to"}, {"start": 1044.0, "text": "implement it in your app and on"}, {"start": 1046.0, "text": "the server."}]}